<title>DENMARK: Deutsche Bnk ups 4 pct bond by 750 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bnk ups 4 pct bond by 750 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Finance is adding a further 750 million Danish crowns to its four percent 2002 bond offer of October 25, bringing the total to 1.75 billion crowns, lead manager Spar Nord said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The Deutsche Bank unit's issue, originally 500 million crowns, was doubled on October 29 and was fully taken up, a Spar Nord statement said.</p>
<p>--Uffe Hansen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969658</p>
</text>
